  "_note": "Dubai Autodrome race tracks (src/lib/autodrome.ts builds each from its points: the centre line in metres, x/z, starting on the main straight past the grandstands). Car and superbike races use the circuits (no sport); horse races the Meydan courses (sport horse) and camel races Al Marmoom (sport camel), with halfWidth metres either side of the centre line (9 on the circuits) and white rails. The host picks one when opening a race; everyone races the same one. minLapMs is the fastest a lap can be (the server refuses a finish time below laps × minLapMs); the ids and minLapMs are mirrored in race_track_rules() (*_race_garage_tracks.sql; checked by scripts/check-life-config.mjs).",
